# Counter-example: a lang:GmnImportedPlane that cites its source work but omits its
# dcterms:hasVersion edition pin — an unpinned import whose alias table is meaningless
# without the edition it was drawn from (fires lang:GmnUnattributedPlane via the
# dcterms:hasVersion sh:minCount of lang:GmnImportedPlaneAttributionShape). The citation
# is present, so the gmeow:cites minCount stays quiet and exactly one finding fires.

@prefix lang:  <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/lang/> .
@prefix gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/> .
@prefix ex:    <http://example.org/lang/> .

ex:planeNoVersion a lang:SignSystem , lang:GmnImportedPlane ;
    gmeow:cites ex:someImportedWork .

ex:someImportedWork a gmeow:CreativeWork .
